// Kills each brick touched, then deflects the ball out of the brick along
// the axis of smallest penetration (both axes on a corner). A per-axis
// guard prevents the classic seam double-inversion: two bricks sharing an
// edge must never cancel each other's bounce.
function bounceBricks(state) {
